  $$https://picsum.photos/seed/demo-margaret-ellison-shaw/800/200$$,
  $$Margaret Ellison Shaw has evaluated higher education and research system reforms in Africa, Latin America and the Middle East for twenty-two years. She has led impact evaluations of scholarship programmes, university partnerships and innovation grants, and advised ministries on tertiary education quality assurance. She mentors early-career evaluators from the countries where she works and edits an academic journal on comparative education. Margaret was previously a professor of education policy and directed an evaluation centre at a Boston university. She works in English and French and has led evaluation teams in more than twenty countries. She also leads evidence reviews on higher education and employability and advises universities on organisational reform.$$,
