  $$https://picsum.photos/seed/demo-andres-castillo-zelaya/800/200$$,
  $$Andrés Castillo Zelaya is a data analyst specializing in public procurement and anti-corruption analytics. Over nine years he has built red-flag indicators, supplier concentration analyses and procurement dashboards from Central American e-procurement portals, first at the Honduran procurement regulator and then as a consultant for civil-society organizations and development banks. He is fluent in the Open Contracting Data Standard, cleans and links contract data with company registries, and presents results in policy briefs that journalists and auditors can use. His work has supported investigations into direct awards in the health sector and the design of digital governance tools that publish contract amendments automatically. He also analyses public works contracts and supports civil society monitoring groups.$$,
