  $$https://picsum.photos/seed/demo-saad-ahmed-malik/800/200$$,
  $$Saad Ahmed Malik is a governance specialist with eleven years of experience in anti-corruption, justice reform and public procurement integrity in Pakistan. He has advised provincial procurement regulatory authorities on e-procurement rules, evaluated anti-corruption establishments, and supported court automation and case management reforms. His policy analysis work includes a national study on procurement complaints and debarment, and he has trained procurement officers and auditors in risk-based audit. Saad writes policy briefs for parliamentary committees and facilitates consultations between government, bar associations and civil-society organizations. He also works on civil service and court administration reform.$$,
